      "text": "if (c0 == 0) {\n    H q1\n    CNOT q1, q6\n    CNOT q1, q5\n    measure q1 -> c0  \n}else{\n    H q2\n    CNOT q2, q5\n    CNOT q2, q6\n    measure q2 -> c1\n}",
